## Acceptance test for this step

Per the "New bin launcher note" section above:

1. **Automated**: scripted-stdin `--no-tui` run for both languages (same
   pattern as `10`'s REPL verification) -- real API call, confirms the
   refactored `Repl` (public `handle_command`/`run_turn`/`banner`,
